                                   Text="1. 梯子" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="处于梯子中的生物不会受到实体挤压伤害。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 马铃耶什，农民的传说之杖" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="马铃耶什引用自《魔兽系列》中的“埃提耶什，守护者的传说之杖”（Atiesh, Greatstaff of the Guardian）。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
